<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">11062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran struck three United States military bases overnight, the most serious exchange since the April eighth ceasefire fell apart in a single day.</s> <s>On Tuesday Trump called the negotiations nearly finished; by Wednesday he'd ordered fresh strikes, accusing Tehran of stringing Washington along.</s> <s>Both sides report no casualties this time... but a ceasefire that exists only on paper offers little protection to the people living beneath it.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Amnesty International says nearly forty thousand Palestinians have been displaced in the occupied West Bank since twenty twenty-three, calling it state-led ethnic cleansing.</s> <s>Its hundred-and-fifty-page report found Israeli forces defied their own Supreme Court orders to let displaced communities return home.</s> <s>Several European governments sanctioned settler officials this week, though the displacement on the ground continues.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt's main civilian opposition, the Civil Democratic Movement, has collapsed nine years after it was founded.</s> <s>Born in twenty seventeen, the coalition fractured after one faction compared a leader's demolished mansion to the mass evictions of the poor.</s> <s>An authoritarian state rarely needs to ban its opposition... when attrition and internal division do the work for it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's Senate has threatened to arrest the former head of the state oil company over two hundred ten trillion naira that auditors say is missing.</s> <s>The gap spans the national petroleum corporation's accounts from twenty seventeen to twenty twenty-three, while the former chief, Mele Kyari, insists total revenue reached only fifty-four trillion.</s> <s>Whether a legislature can compel its own elite to answer remains the real test.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Across the Pacific islands, the Middle East oil crisis is landing hardest on women.</s> <s>Island economies import every drop of fuel, and women absorb the cuts first because their livelihoods depend on transport and reaching the market.</s> <s>Emergency declarations protect shipping routes... but leave the cost in women's time, earnings and safety unaddressed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Masked rioters torched cars and buildings in Belfast after footage of a knife attack spread online.</s> <s>Northern Ireland has seen this pattern before, where viral video outpaces verified fact and calls for violence quickly follow.</s> <s>Britain's communications regulator has warned platforms over incitement, as the United Nations rights chief called the disorder shocking.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India and Oman's free trade pact took effect on the first of June, and its quiet value is geography.</s> <s>Most of Oman's coastline lies outside the Strait of Hormuz, handing India a Gulf gateway that sidesteps the world's most contested chokepoint just as war chokes it.</s> <s>Whether India reroutes significant trade depends on how long the conflict keeps the strait closed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has extended its nationwide austerity drive into a fourth month, all because of a war it has no part in.</s> <s>The Middle East conflict forced four-day government work weeks and fuel rationing back in March, in a country that imports most of its crude.</s> <s>Its Intelligence Bureau is now auditing compliance, with results due before the end of June.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China's BYD has abandoned a billion-dollar electric-vehicle factory in Turkey, choosing Hungary instead.</s> <s>The carmaker wants tariff-free access to the European Union, and Hungary delivers it while Turkey's customs union leaves it outside Europe's proposed made-in-Europe content rules.</s> <s>The promised Turkish plant, for now, remains a grass-covered field.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Floods in Sumatra killed at least fifty-eight Tapanuli orangutans, wiping out seven percent of the rarest great ape on Earth.</s> <s>The same deluge killed more than twelve hundred people in Indonesia, a disaster that deforestation turned from heavy rain into catastrophe.</s> <s>Researchers surveyed only one of three forest blocks... so the full toll on a species numbering just eight hundred is still unknown.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Earth's energy imbalance has reached its highest ten-year average ever recorded.</s> <s>That imbalance measures the solar heat coming in against what the planet radiates back, and it's now the truest gauge of how fast warming is accelerating.</s> <s>Emissions reached fifty-six point eight billion tonnes of carbon dioxide equivalent in twenty twenty-four, and the gap keeps widening.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Papua New Guinea, Fiji and Vanuatu have agreed to connect and expand their marine protected areas to six million square kilometres.</s> <s>These nations argue a reserve must match the scale of the ecosystem it protects, since fish stocks and ocean currents ignore national borders.</s> <s>It would become one of the largest such reserves on the planet, if the pledges hold, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Europe has signed a seven-hundred-million-euro contract for a new generation of Earth-observing radar.</s> <s>Italy's Thales Alenia Space will build two satellites whose radar sees through cloud to track ice loss, floods and shifting ground, sharpening resolution fourfold to five metres.</s> <s>A delay has already pushed the launch beyond twenty thirty-two.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>South Korea has fined Coupang, its largest online retailer, a record four hundred eight million dollars over a data breach.</s> <s>Regulators found the company exposed thirty-three million users' records through weak authentication, then delayed telling anyone.</s> <s>Coupang disputes the scale, claiming only three thousand records actually leaked.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Boeing's autonomous Ghost Bat combat drone now carries air-to-air missiles hidden inside internal bays.</s> <s>Tucking weapons out of sight preserves the stealth that external mounts would betray, turning an expendable drone into a true fighting aircraft.</s> <s>Australia already flies eight of the earlier models, pushing the human ever further from the decision to kill.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A court in Munich has held Google liable for false answers produced by its AI search summaries.</s> <s>Search engines have long escaped responsibility by merely indexing others' content, but the judges ruled that rewriting it makes Google the author, not a neutral pipe.</s> <s>Germany's decision cracks a liability shield the entire industry has leaned on.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>